<Layout
  title="NEMA 14-50 Outlet Installation & Repair in Issaquah | EV-Rated Sockets"
  description="Heavy-duty NEMA 14-50 outlet installation and melted outlet repair in Issaquah WA. Industrial-grade EV-rated receptacles. Call (425) 380-0019."
