        <p class="hero-lead">Standard hardware-store outlets were designed for intermittent stove use, not 8 continuous hours of 32-amp EV charging. We install and replace industrial-grade, EV-rated NEMA 14-50 receptacles built to withstand sustained thermal loads.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta-wrap">
          <a href="tel:+14253800019" class="btn btn-lime"><span>📞</span><span>Call (425) 380-0019</span></a>
