          <li>Installation of industrial-grade Bryant or Hubbell EV-rated 50A sockets</li>
          <li>Dedicated 50-amp dual-pole circuit with proper wire sizing</li>
          <li>Terminal screw torque verification to manufacturer specifications</li>
          <li>GFCI breaker protection compliant with current NEC garage requirements</li>
