            Properly torqued terminal lugs and 50-amp dual-pole breaker meeting strict WAC 296-46B safety requirements.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>


        <p>For technical questions about nema 14-50 outlet install & repair in Issaquah, call our dispatch line directly at <a href="tel:+14253800019">(425) 380-0019</a>. Licensed under <a href="https://apps.leg.wa.gov/WAC/default.aspx?cite=296-46B" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WAC 296-46B</a> and fully compliant with NEC Article 625 standards.</p>
